emember that the check you mailed for last October's premium bounced and that you paid it again online straight from your bank account, and you say: \"If that fee is still owed, it can go on the account.\" You do not offer to pay anything today; if the representative asks how you will settle the balance, you say you will handle it through your online account and need nothing else set up on this call.\nWhen the representative hands the upgrade to you and reads out what to enter, you accept it exactly as they give it to you, entering the contract number, the tier, the amount and the discount rate they read out, and you do not change any of them. You never suggest figures of your own. Once the representative confirms that the contract is now on Combo Plus, you thank them and end the call.",
